---
import { Briefcase, ArrowRight } from '@lucide/astro';
---

<section id="experience" class="mb-40 px-6 md:px-12 lg:px-24">
  <div
    class="mb-16 flex items-end justify-between border-b border-surface-container-low pb-8 transition-colors"
  >
    <div>
      <h2 class="font-headline mb-2 text-3xl font-bold text-on-background md:text-4xl">Professional Arc</h2>
      <p class="font-body text-on-surface-variant">Experience and impact.</p>
    </div>
    <Briefcase class="h-10 w-10 shrink-0 text-primary opacity-50 md:h-11 md:w-11" stroke-width={1.25} aria-hidden="true" />
  </div>

  <div class="space-y-12 border-l border-outline-variant/30 pl-4 transition-colors md:pl-8">
    <!-- Consultant Role -->
    <div class="group relative">
      <div
        class="absolute -left-[41px] top-1 h-4 w-4 rounded-full border-2 border-primary bg-surface transition-colors group-hover:bg-primary md:-left-[49px]"
        aria-hidden="true"
      >
      </div>
      <div
        class="ml-6 overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-outline-variant/15 bg-surface-container-low p-8 transition-all hover:bg-surface-container"
      >
        <div class="mb-6 flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-start md:justify-between">
          <div>
            <h3 class="font-headline mb-1 text-2xl font-bold text-on-background">Software Development Consultant I</h3>
            <p class="text-lg font-medium text-primary">Lumen Technologies</p>
            <p class="mt-1 font-body text-sm text-on-surface-variant">Bengaluru, India · October 2025 – Present</p>
          </div>
          <span class="font-label mt-2 block text-sm uppercase tracking-widest text-on-surface-variant md:mt-0"
            >Current</span
          >
        </div>
        <div class="space-y-4 font-body leading-relaxed text-on-surface-variant">
          <p class="flex gap-3">
            <ArrowRight class="mt-1 h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-primary" stroke-width={2} aria-hidden="true" />
            <span
              >Leading the containerization and modernization of legacy Tomcat, WildFly, JBoss, and Restlet enterprise applications into <strong class="font-medium text-on-surface">Spring Boot microservices</strong> on <strong class="font-medium text-on-surface">Kubernetes / Rancher (GCP)</strong> from architecture through production delivery.</span
            >
          </p>
          <p class="flex gap-3">
            <ArrowRight class="mt-1 h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-primary" stroke-width={2} aria-hidden="true" />
            <span
              >Building a <strong class="font-medium text-on-surface">Databricks-based data hub</strong> to replace legacy mainframe systems, enabling high-performance large-scale data platform capabilities alongside backend services.</span
            >
          </p>
          <p class="flex gap-3">
            <ArrowRight class="mt-1 h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-primary" stroke-width={2} aria-hidden="true" />
            <span
              >Administering Linux-hosted production environments with deep observability tooling (<strong class="font-medium text-on-surface">Splunk, AppDynamics, Datadog</strong>) and JVM thread/heap dump profiling to accelerate incident resolution and reduce MTTR.</span
            >
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Engineer Role -->
    <div class="group relative">
      <div
        class="absolute -left-[41px] top-1 h-4 w-4 rounded-full border-2 border-primary bg-surface transition-colors group-hover:bg-primary md:-left-[49px]"
        aria-hidden="true"
      >
      </div>
      <div
        class="ml-6 overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-outline-variant/15 bg-surface-container-low p-8 transition-all hover:bg-surface-container"
      >
        <div class="mb-6 flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-start md:justify-between">
          <div>
            <h3 class="font-headline mb-1 text-2xl font-bold text-on-background">Software Development Engineer</h3>
            <p class="text-lg font-medium text-primary">Lumen Technologies</p>
            <p class="mt-1 font-body text-sm text-on-surface-variant">Bengaluru, India · July 2023 – October 2025</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="space-y-4 font-body leading-relaxed text-on-surface-variant">
          <p class="flex gap-3">
            <ArrowRight class="mt-1 h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-primary" stroke-width={2} aria-hidden="true" />
            <span
              >Led migration of production REST applications from Restlet to <strong class="font-medium text-on-surface">Spring Boot</strong>, containerizing workloads with Docker and deploying to <strong class="font-medium text-on-surface">Kubernetes / Rancher on GCP</strong>.</span
            >
          </p>
          <p class="flex gap-3">
            <ArrowRight class="mt-1 h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-primary" stroke-width={2} aria-hidden="true" />
            <span
              >Built and maintained an external-facing <strong class="font-medium text-on-surface">Spring Boot REST API</strong> powering real-time address-search autocomplete for customer service qualification.</span
            >
          </p>
          <p class="flex gap-3">
            <ArrowRight class="mt-1 h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-primary" stroke-width={2} aria-hidden="true" />
            <span
              >Architected Java / Spring Boot / Hibernate microservices validating telecom service qualification across a shared relational database under high concurrency (<strong class="font-medium text-on-surface">100,000+ req/day</strong>).</span
            >
          </p>
          <p class="flex gap-3">
            <ArrowRight class="mt-1 h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-primary" stroke-width={2} aria-hidden="true" />
            <span
              >Developed concurrent batch ingestion modules utilizing <strong class="font-medium text-on-surface">RabbitMQ</strong> and Java concurrency patterns for resilient data synchronization.</span
            >
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
